      "category": "ai",
      "title": "Position: LLMs Can't Jump",
      "url": "https://openreview.net/challenge?redirect=%2Fforum%3Fid%3DklU4737opt",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49181083",
      "score": 207,
      "comments": 139,
      "author": "theanonymousone",
      "published": "2026-08-05T11:01:37Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Autoregressive transformers natively struggle with non-local state transitions, global graph search, and non-linear algorithmic leaps.",
        "Without explicit search scaffolding like Tree-of-Thoughts or dynamic tools, pure next-token prediction fails on complex combinatorial planning.",
        "AI practitioners must pair LLMs with external symbolic solvers and deterministic planners rather than relying solely on model scale."
      ]
    },
    {
