      "published": "2026-08-05T13:33:16Z",
      "bullets": [
        "3D Gaussian Splatting replaces implicit NeRFs with parameterized 3D Gaussians, enabling real-time differentiable rendering and explicit scene representation.",
        "Interactive Gaussian painting allows direct modification of primitive attributes, including covariance matrices, opacity, and spherical harmonics coefficients.",
        "Custom CUDA rasterization pipelines optimize GPU memory access to deliver high-resolution, photorealistic rendering at over 100 FPS."
      ]
    },
