      "bullets": [
        "Systemic security failures stem from architectural complexity and configuration drift rather than isolated, easily patchable software vulnerabilities.",
        "Defense-in-depth requires automated policy enforcement in CI/CD pipelines to mitigate human error in access control and credential management.",
        "Effective security postures balance developer velocity with friction-free guardrails, robust default configurations, and continuous threat monitoring."
      ]
    },
